@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@admin.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1. Escutar o Stream (SSE)
# O plugin REST Client manterá essa conexão aberta recebendo os dados em tempo real.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/sessions/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
Cache-Control: no-cache

### connect whatsapp
# @name connectWhatsapp
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/sessions/connect
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

